{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 44,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0728759765625,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "of oxygen continues for some time afterwards. One way to try and stop this damage",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.04296875,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "is to induce hypothermia by cooling the baby or just the baby’s head for hours to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.09283447265625,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "reduce the amount of damage to brain cells. The evidence from trials show that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.1429138183594,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "induced hypothermia helps to improve survival and development at 18 months for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.09283447265625,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "term newborn babies at risk of brain damage. However, all the studies were done in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.03271484375,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "highly resourced, neonatal intensive care units with adequate support with no data",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        210.2529296875,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "from settings in developing countries.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.0914001464844,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "Eight RCTs were included in this review, comprising 638 term infants with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.0628662109375,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "moderate or severe encephalopathy and evidence of intrapartum asphyxia [Jacobs,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.10284423828125,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "2007]. Six were performed as pilot studies, three in single centres in New Zealand,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.10284423828125,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Turkey and China; and the others at multiple centres in Australia and North",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.1329040527344,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "America. All 8 trials included term newborn infants with moderate or severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.0928955078125,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "encephalopathy and evidence of intrapartum hypoxia-ischaemia without obvious",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        399.0228576660156,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "congenital abnormalities. Infants in all studies were randomised with initiation of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        241.7421112060547,
        396.7326965332031,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "the intervention by six hours of age [mean age at entry range: 1.9 hours to 4.6 hours].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.1015319824219,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Therapeutic hypothermia resulted in a statistically significant and clinically",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.7420959472656,
        396.8529052734375,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "important reduction in the combined outcome of mortality or major neuro­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        399.03271484375,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "developmental disability to 18 months of age (typical RR 0.76, 95% CI 0.65, 0.89;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.7420959472656,
        399.0427551269531,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "typical RD -0.15, 95% CI -0.24, -0.07; NNT 7, 95% CI 4,14). Cooling also resulted in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.7420959472656,
        399.07269287109375,
        320.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "statistically significant reductions in mortality (typical RR 0.74, 95% CI 0.58, 0.94;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.7420959472656,
        399.09271240234375,
        333.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "typical RD -0.09, 95% CI -0.16, -0.02; NNT 11, 95% CI 6, 50) and in neurodevelopmental",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.7420959472656,
        399.08258056640625,
        346.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "disability in survivors (typical RR 0.68, 95% CI 0.51, 0.92; typical RD -0.13, 95%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.7420959472656,
        399.10284423828125,
        359.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "CI -0.23, -0.03). Some adverse effects of hypothermia included an increase in the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        358.7420959472656,
        399.0630798339844,
        372.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "need for inotrope support of borderline significance and a significant increase in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        371.7420959472656,
        139.54287719726562,
        385.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "thrombocytopaenia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        384.7420959472656,
        399.0513610839844,
        398.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "This result is both statistically significant and clinically important, with a relative",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        397.7420959472656,
        332.3329162597656,
        411.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "risk reduction of 24%, absolute risk reduction of 15%, and NNT of 7.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        422.2607116699219,
        163.95286560058594,
        434.2507019042969
      ],
      "text": "5.6.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        437.9054260253906,
        88.77290344238281,
        450.04541015625
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        450.9154052734375,
        399.1328430175781,
        464.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "There clear benefits of cooling on survival and neurodevelopment which outweigh",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        463.9154052734375,
        348.4128112792969,
        477.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "the short-term adverse effects associated with therapeutic hypothermia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        485.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        497.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        498.4192810058594,
        399.0929260253906,
        511.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "There is possible increased risk of thrombocytopaenia and hypotension from the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        511.4193115234375,
        160.34288024902344,
        524.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "therapeutic hypothermia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        535.9378662109375,
        205.31298828125,
        547.9279174804688
      ],
      "text": "5.6.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        551.5924682617188,
        399.1227111816406,
        565.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "Parents may be willing to allow their child to undergo this procedure as they would",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        564.5924682617188,
        399.12286376953125,
        578.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "reasonably expect that cooling would decrease their baby’s chance of dying and may",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        577.5924682617188,
        320.6028137207031,
        591.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "lessen the occurrence of a major disability, if their child survived.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.3970947265625,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6501007080078,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "30",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}